Docker documentation excerpts
=============================

The Markdown pages in this directory are excerpts of the Docker documentation,
fetched from https://docs.docker.com on 2026-11-14 by scripts/fetch_docker_docs.py.

Docker documentation is Copyright Docker, Inc. and contributors, and is licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE in this directory, copied from
https://github.com/docker/docs). Source repository: https://github.com/docker/docs

Changes made to the original pages:
  - The rendered Markdown of each page (served at <page-url>.md) was saved,
    rather than the Hugo source.
  - Any remaining Hugo shortcodes ({{< ... >}} and {{% ... %}}) were removed,
    trailing whitespace was trimmed and runs of blank lines were collapsed.
  - A "Source: <page-url>" line and a blank line were added at the top of each
    page.
  - Only a subset of pages was kept (Docker Desktop, Docker Hub, accounts,
    subscription and billing, security, support, FAQs, get started, Scout,
    Compose and user-facing extensions pages); release notes, security
    announcements and the extensions SDK were left out.

